    "decision": {
      "action": "replace",
      "decision_id": "D000921",
      "disposition": "existing_equivalent",
      "rationale": "Stacks now defines G-equivariant A-torsors and nonabelian equivariant Cech H^1 as a pointed-set colimit over free G-coverings, proves canonical refinement maps and classification by isomorphism classes, and identifies the abelian specialization with both equivariant Cech and derived H^1. This is the precise mathematical content of the source's G-A-bundle interpretation; its broader observation about transporting Chapter V of [11] and its proposed noncommutative homological algebra remain programmatic historical remarks.",
